        "worked_solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}y}(\\operatorname{sech}\u2061y)=-\\operatorname{sech}\u2061y\\operatorname{tanh}\u2061y\\,\u21d2\\,\\int \\operatorname{sech}\u2061y\\operatorname{tanh}\u2061y\\,\\text{d}y=-\\operatorname{sech}\u2061y+C,\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}y}(\\operatorname{csch}\u2061y)=-\\operatorname{csch}\u2061y\\operatorname{coth}\u2061y\\,\u21d2\\,\\int \\operatorname{csch}\u2061y\\operatorname{coth}\u2061y\\,\\text{d}y=-\\operatorname{csch}\u2061y+C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (2\\operatorname{csch}\u2061y\\operatorname{coth}\u2061y-9\\operatorname{sech}\u2061y\\operatorname{tanh}\u2061y)\\text{d}y & =\\int 2\\operatorname{csch}\u2061y\\operatorname{coth}\u2061y\\,\\text{d}y+\\int (-9\\operatorname{sech}\u2061y\\operatorname{tanh}\u2061y)\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =2\\int \\operatorname{csch}\u2061y\\operatorname{coth}\u2061y\\,\\text{d}y-9\\int \\operatorname{sech}\u2061y\\operatorname{tanh}\u2061y\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =2(-\\operatorname{csch}\u2061y)-9(-\\operatorname{sech}\u2061y)+C \\\\  & =9\\operatorname{sech}\u2061y-2\\operatorname{csch}\u2061y+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
